Act as a professional college timetable coordinator. Create a well-organized weekly class timetable for a second-year CSE (Computer Science and Engineering) section with 6 subjects.

Requirements:

- Include (Tamil, english, maths, physics, chemistry, computer science)
- Prepare a timetable from Monday to Friday.
- Include 6 periods per day.
- Allocate suitable time slots for each subject.
- Include breaks and lunch time.
- Distribute subjects evenly throughout the week.
- Avoid repeating the same subject too frequently.
- Present the timetable in a clear table format.

